        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_k"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 85a of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the shoulder note, by inserting after the word “buildings” the words “and slopes”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by substituting for the definition of “owner” the following definition: ‘ “owner” means owner of a building or land and in relation to a subdivided building includes— (a) the owner of a parcel of the building; (b) any person who is responsible for the building; or (c) the joint management body and management corporation under the Strata Management Act 2013 [Act 757].’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_c__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the word “only”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words “ a storey” the words “, and a land with slope having a gradient more than twenty-five degrees and total vertical height more than ten metres, whether such land erected with or without building”."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (3)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by deleting the words “the owner of a building, require the building to be inspected”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “(a) the owner of a building, require the building to be inspected— (i) after the tenth year commencing from the date the certificate of completion and compliance in respect of the building was issued; and (ii) thereafter at intervals of not more than ten years from the date of the completion of the last inspection of the building; and”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_d",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (b) the following paragraph: “(b) the owner of a land with slope, require the slope to be inspected— (i) after the fifth year commencing from the date of the possession of land in respect of the slope; and (ii) thereafter at intervals of not more than five years from the date of the completion of the last inspection of the slope.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/18/eng@/~cl_5__para_e",
