      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subparagraph (ii) the following subparagraph: “(iia) if the structural plans, structural calculations or geotechnical report referred to in subparagraph (ii) is not available, the engineer shall reconstruct such plans, calculations or report where the local authority so requires, with a view to determine any inadequacy in the structural elements of the building or slope;”; and"
      }
    },
